- content_for :title, "Solutions ... OurGruuv"

%section.marketing-hero
  .container
    %p.marketing-kicker Solutions · The Path
    %h1.mb-3 Replace glorified forms with a talent growth system
    %p.lead.mb-4
      MAAP and check-ins. Goals tied to them. Feedback and kudos tied to them. Organized by who you are at work.

    %p.mb-0
      New to the philosophy?
      = link_to "Read Team Flow State →", flow_state_path

%section.marketing-section.marketing-section-alt
  .container
    %p.marketing-kicker People Team / HR
    %h2.h3.mb-3 Equip the company without becoming the enemy
    %p.marketing-bad
      Forms that vanish. Disconnected shout-outs. Feedback trapped in the HRIS ... or never written down. The People Team is cast as compliance, not enablement.
    %p.marketing-good.mb-4
      With OurGruuv, you stand up clarity systems everyone can use ... and sell talent density upward with leading indicators the business can see.

    %h3.h6.mb-2 Clarity
    %ul
      %li
        %strong MAAP & growth paths
        \... positions, assignments, abilities, aspirations; what good looks like, visible.
      %li
        %strong Clarity check-ins
        \... continuous evidence instead of review-season archaeology.
    %h3.h6.mb-2 Challenge
    %ul
      %li
        %strong Goals tied to MAAP elements
        \... stretch that maps to real abilities and assignments, not orphan OKRs.
    %h3.h6.mb-2 Continuous Feedback
    %ul.mb-0
      %li
        %strong Observations (feedback & kudos)
        \... tied to abilities, assignments, and values so recognition and coaching are specific and fair.

%section.marketing-section
  .container
    %p.marketing-kicker Employees
    %h2.h3.mb-3 Know where you stand ... grow beyond promotions
    %p.marketing-bad
      Surprises in reviews. Vague feedback. Growth that only means “wait for a title.”
    %p.marketing-good.mb-4
      Continuous clarity on expectations and demonstrated progress ... so you can act before the cycle closes.

    %h3.h6.mb-2 Clarity
    %ul
      %li Growth views grounded in assignments, abilities, and values ... not vibes.
      %li Check-ins that tell you where you stand with specifics you can use.
    %h3.h6.mb-2 Challenge
    %ul
      %li Goals connected to the same growth path ... stretch with a map.
    %h3.h6.mb-2 Continuous Feedback
    %ul.mb-0
      %li Feedback and kudos you can see against the work you actually do.

%section.marketing-section.marketing-section-alt
  .container
    %p.marketing-kicker Managers
    %h2.h3.mb-3 Coaching with an order-of-magnitude better toolkit
    %p.marketing-bad
      Strong gut feel, weak receipts. Verbal feedback that evaporates. Calibration from memory.
    %p.marketing-good.mb-4
      Coaching tied to specific assignment abilities and values ... so fairness and growth don’t depend on who remembers what.

    %h3.h6.mb-2 Clarity
    %ul
      %li Shared MAAP language with your team ... expectations you can point to.
      %li Check-ins that produce evidence, not theater.
    %h3.h6.mb-2 Challenge
    %ul
      %li Goals that stretch people against abilities that matter on the assignment.
    %h3.h6.mb-2 Continuous Feedback
    %ul.mb-0
      %li Observations ... feedback and kudos ... anchored to the same elements you coach against.

    .d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-2.mt-5
      = link_to "Start Free", start_free_path, class: "btn btn-dark btn-lg px-4"
      = link_to "Flow State", flow_state_path, class: "btn btn-link btn-lg text-decoration-none"
